{"repository":"github/gh-aw","workflowName":"Smoke Pydantic AI","adoptionAt":"2026-08-07T20:57:43Z","evaluationMode":"attainment-only","window":{"startAt":"2026-08-07T20:57:43Z","endAt":"2026-10-18T15:00:12Z"},"evidenceCoverage":{"completeFromAdoption":false,"hasPreAdoptionBaseline":false,"baselineDescription":"No pre-adoption comparison is included; observations begin at adoption.","reason":"No comparable pre-adoption outcome evaluation is established for this contract."},"runs":[],"caveat":"The evidence measures post-adoption attainment only; without a comparable pre-adoption baseline it cannot establish improvement or causation.","schemaVersion":3,"definitionSchemaVersion":3,"generatedAt":"2026-10-19T12:48:47Z","workflowSlug":"smoke-pydantic","sourcePath":".github/workflows/smoke-pydantic.md","valueFunction":{"path":"docs/operational-value/proof/functions/smoke-pydantic.mjs","sha256":"d118b48470a52c1e8382978dd11dc6c98c6360282dc5b798c6fc20264e1b032b","definition":{"schemaVersion":3,"slug":"smoke-pydantic","repository":"github/gh-aw","workflowName":"Smoke Pydantic AI","sourcePath":".github/workflows/smoke-pydantic.md","intent":{"goal":"Verify Pydantic AI inference, safeoutputs MCP availability and an actual read_file read of root README.md; persist the prescribed report and conditional PR outputs.","acceptance":"A protected native invocation/result pair proves read_file returned the first line of root README.md, matching the immutable checkout bytes at the actual run revision. A quote, arithmetic answer, issue, green job, declaration or shell read alone is insufficient.","temporalAnchor":"workflow-adoption"},"adoption":{"commit":"0e301e6777bef1d23305c8031dcd161a642836f5","adoptedAt":"2026-08-07T20:57:43Z","baselineCommit":"cc3330af665107c4e4e1b8dbff618ae23b792314","baselineAt":"2026-08-07T20:55:45Z"},"evaluation":{"mode":"attainment-only"},"interpretation":"Historical source-grounded reconstruction, not ex-ante acceptance or a causal experiment.","referenceRevision":"c86377ec47b38f0b5af463277ee55d1d03d08da8","sourceGitBlob":"39e64a09ad74877e7533d69f858e9a479f9ce318","acceptanceSha256":"790e5607970f0aa1bc7c34db30f42f2461796e2eef30178b666b680ce8900f0d","contract":{"schemaVersion":1,"contractVersion":"smoke-pydantic-native-v1","frozenBeforeNativeResultInspection":true,"interpretation":"Historical source-grounded reconstruction, not ex-ante acceptance or a causal experiment.","repository":"github/gh-aw","repositoryId":1036865607,"referenceRevision":"c86377ec47b38f0b5af463277ee55d1d03d08da8","cutoff":"2026-10-18T15:00:12Z","sourcePath":".github/workflows/smoke-pydantic.md","sourceGitBlob":"39e64a09ad74877e7533d69f858e9a479f9ce318","goal":"Verify Pydantic AI inference, safeoutputs MCP availability and an actual read_file read of root README.md; persist the prescribed report and conditional PR outputs.","primary":{"id":"native-read-cases","opportunity":"An original smoke-pydantic Pydantic AI engine service lifetime with the source-prescribed README capability test.","acceptance":"A protected native invocation/result pair proves read_file returned the first line of root README.md, matching the immutable checkout bytes at the actual run revision. A quote, arithmetic answer, issue, green job, declaration or shell read alone is insufficient.","formula":"Count distinct runId/attempt service lifetimes with an accepted root README file-tool read, once per lifetime.","unit":"verified read cases","direction":"increase","actorIndependent":true},"facets":{"inference":"Native provider request/response evidence bound to the Pydantic engine proves the prescribed 2+2 answer; an issue claim alone is insufficient.","mcpAvailability":"Protected native tool enumeration or a successful safeoutputs MCP invocation proves actual availability; configuration alone is insufficient.","transport":"Independent native protocol or transport receipt, bound to the invocation, proves the transport actually used; source configuration is not execution proof.","safeOutputPersistence":"A protected safe-output consumer receipt binds the run/attempt and emitted create_issue payload to the actual persistent issue identity. Agent output or editable footer alone is not persistence proof.","fullGoal":"All three source-prescribed tests plus persisted required issue; for pull_request events also the prescribed comment and success-only label. Exact source/import/compiled applicability and all required receipts must be established.","contribution":"Protected original producer execution identity binds an accepted native effect to smoke-pydantic. Corroborated editable issue links remain discovery only.","costs":"Only matching actual workflow-version/run/period costs, separately reported; no invented credits, dollars, time saved or cost per unknown outcome."},"evidencePolicy":{"sourceApplicability":"Inspect and pin coherent source/import/compiled profiles before native-result inspection. Older incompatible profiles stay unknown, not retrospectively failed. Introduction and applicability are separate.","discovery":"Use production readOutputHistory over every partition, follow forward and reverse relatedCandidates to closure, retain absent references. Discovery is not outcome evidence.","scope":"At most two initial native run attempts; a partial population remains partial. No borrowed engine-conformance or other workflow cases.","deduplication":"Deduplicate the same case within runId/attempt service lifetime before assigning the native effect timestamp to an interval.","clock":"Native invocation and completion ordering must be valid and not after observedAt or the frozen cutoff. Interval starts inclusive and ends exclusive.","periods":"Seven-day duration and cadence, zero maturation; cutoff-aligned disjoint periods. Missing periods null, not zero; known per-case nonattainment is not complete-population zero.","missing":"Preserve proven narrow native subtotals through missing other facets or incomplete population coverage. Missing intrinsic read evidence remains null.","adoption":"Prove actual initial source/compiled addition against its real parent. Missing objects do not prove exhaustion or absence. Do not fabricate a temporal anchor to satisfy the evaluator.","decision":"Not rated: no source-defined native keep bar, complete-history requirement or causal attribution rule has been supplied."}},"sourceProfiles":{"schemaVersion":1,"reviewedBeforeNativeResultInspection":true,"referenceProfile":{"sourceGitBlob":"39e64a09ad74877e7533d69f858e9a479f9ce318","compiledGitBlob":"970bf8971b00ee0aafe924cb19a52e713607fda8","importRepository":"pydantic/pydantic-ai","importRevision":"4f6799896fcb386cc5d0af7e84b4b17c17dd14c3","importPath":"src/pydantic_ai_harness/gh-aw/pydantic.md","importGitBlob":"511d7739e450de70cd4553ad750b620497b2e87b","engine":"pydantic-ai","harnessVersion":"0.56.0","cli":"clai2","workspace":"Native session.init cwd must identify the checkout; source LocalWorkspace('.') and spawn cwd=GITHUB_WORKSPACE bind local filesystem tools to that checkout."},"nativeAuthority":{"recorder":"Installed Pydantic FunctionToolCallEvent/FunctionToolResultEvent and TextPart callbacks emit canonical records; shell/model stdout is sunk separately.","frameSelection":"Use the first native GH-AW-SESSION-KEY header and only matching GH-AW-SESSION frames, matching the pinned parser's allowlist. Keep malformed-frame diagnostics.","binding":"Require original public metadata, exact producer path/run/attempt/head, protected agent execution step, provider-digest-checked original agent ZIP, and artifact agent_execution run/attempt evidence.","read":"Require an ordered native read_file invocation/result pair, unambiguous root README path, native success and returned first-line bytes equal the immutable run-head README blob. Unsupported output projections remain unknown.","mcp":"A successful native create_issue MCP tool invocation establishes availability under the reviewed default Coder plus MCP composition; it does not establish persistent issue creation.","inference":"A recorder-captured assistant TextPart containing the prescribed short arithmetic answer establishes the narrow model response; prompt text or output issue claims do not.","deduplication":"One accepted case of each facet per run/attempt service lifetime; repeated tool calls do not multiply useful effects."},"initialProfile":{"sourceGitBlob":"3f18d68fd4879a7e4b7d5b507a1dc2515529a3f3","compiledGitBlob":"06170cd9a152bc4ec53d46c88bb6da5d375a2330","goal":"Write a run-specific test file, verify it with bash cat, and run git log; append safe-output JSON lines.","applicability":"Incompatible with the later inference/MCP/read_file goal. Introduction is established, but no later acceptance is backdated to this era."},"runProfiles":[{"runId":38984441491,"attempt":1,"headSha":"354b5c3423ea95046f4db235f9fea7bb2885aaa8","sourceGitBlob":"39e64a09ad74877e7533d69f858e9a479f9ce318","compiledGitBlob":"27f3d4956bb7ac7c12c92d5a01bce4f5e474938e","readmeGitBlob":"3256c0de0441f39b1fc5cca047528c8562ec7bf5","runtime":"canonical-framed-clai2","review":"Actual run-head source, compiled recorder/parser, immutable README and exact imported source were inspected before native results."},{"runId":37862661287,"attempt":1,"headSha":"e6b87a4f169c7d194aa5f862f9b6e983ad11d3ae","sourceGitBlob":"e604196f28aaa5d518939d6ed5a3a2333d90e759","compiledGitBlob":"e425f72675576cc0f0e4fa1beeb2ff5436278bfc","readmeGitBlob":"09e12bd6dc0e2cf620569fff7e76ff6c19c278ab","importRevision":"319d72ccf220427e59b9f4e61f17d7be52c90d68","importGitBlob":"4eb0d9726a6e0f47f970e1150818465bed15c07f","harnessVersion":"0.35.0","runtime":"legacy-pai-console","review":"Same three prescribed goals. Exact historical import, compiled legacy parser and immutable README inspected before native results. The parser manufactures tool-use/result-shaped entries from console text with empty arguments; those derived entries are not native read proof. Preserve the older runtime profile without promoting it to th